  $impeccable audit — Módulo de Informes (H + NH)

  Scope: informes-h and informes-nh components, plus the --app-* token system, patterns, typography, and motion layers they depend on.

  Anti-Patterns Verdict — PASS

  This does not look AI-generated. It reads as a deliberately restrained enterprise tool. Concretely, none of the usual tells are present:

  - No gradient text, no glassmorphism, no hero-metric blocks, no identical icon-card grids.
  - No tracked-uppercase eyebrows over sections, no 01/02/03 numbered scaffolding.
  - No side-stripe accent borders.
  - Card uses 1px border + shadow-xs where shadow-xs = 0 1px 2px / 0.05 (2px blur) — this is not the ghost-card defect (which needs ≥16px blur); it's a legitimate hairline.
  - Card radius is --app-radius-md (not the 24/28/32px over-round tell).
  - Hero/heading uses text-heading-lg capping at ~31px — nowhere near the 6rem ceiling.
  - Single font (Inter), tokenized everything, documented per-pair contrast ratios.

  The token system is genuinely first-rate: single source of truth, WCAG ratios annotated inline, light-mode-only as an explicit decision, reduced-motion enforced globally and per-pattern.

